<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Venturing</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="index.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/header') %>
    <div class="page" style="background-image: url('./assets/venturing_background.jpg');">
        <div class="content">
            <h1>VENTURING: Crew 1548</h1>
            <div>
                <p>
                    Venturing is a youth-led leadership program that is designed for young adults that
                    want to test their limits and expand the bounds of what is possible. Crew 1548 was formed to
                    connect friends and family around high adventure.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The Venturing program is divided into four areas: Adventure, Leadership, Personal Growth,
                    and Service. Each of these pillars represent a unique aspect of the Venturing program. In a
                    Crew’s program, the focus is to provide opportunities in all four areas.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Crew 1548 works very closely with Olympic Adventure Experience. Their main focus is
                    mountaineering.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


</body>
</html>